builds to Frida Bernal and Florence Little. But, without any forensic evidence from the crimes, it's unlikely that the killer's identity will ever be known. Harold Jones continued to terrorise the people of Abitolleri even after his release from prison. When organ music was heard emanating from the front room of the Jones family home, rumours circulated that he was back in town. In 1950, he was spotted visiting the graves of Frida Bernal and Florence Little.

